        "mulaExtract": "एवं मिथ्यात्वलक्षणपञ्चकं, दृश्यत्वादिहेतुचतुष्टयं, प्रत्यक्षानुमानागमबाधोद्धारं, दृग्दृश्यसम्बन्धानुपपत्तिं च निरूप्य प्रथमो भागः परिसमाप्तः ।",
        "mulaIast": "evaṁ mithyātva-lakṣaṇa-pañcakaṁ, dṛśyatvādi-hetu-catuṣṭayaṁ, pratyakṣānumānāgama-bādhoddhāraṁ, dṛg-dṛśya-sambandhānupapattiṁ ca nirūpya prathamo bhāgaḥ parisamāptaḥ |",
        "englishExplanation": "Brahmānanda summarizes the grand architecture of Part 1 of Pariccheda 1: five definitions of falsity, four probantia, defeat of all perceptual/inferential/scriptural objections, and the relational proof of cosmic superimposition."
